## 2.2 Missing Values

Missing values were examined to determine whether any observations needed to be removed or addressed before conducting the regression analysis.

```{r quality}
# Missing values in all variables
colSums(is.na(airbnb))

# Missing values in our selected variables
selected_vars <- c(
  "price",
  "neighbourhood_group",
  "room_type",
  "calculated_host_listings_count",
  "availability_365",
  "minimum_nights",
  "number_of_reviews"
)

colSums(is.na(airbnb[selected_vars]))
```

The selected regression variables contained no missing values. However, reviews_per_month contained 10,052 missing observations. This variable was not included in the proposed regression model.

